   '2022-02-23', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'c6bad0807970e60bcf50dc54bbcf664feb30db0bdbd1df1b1dc2acfabc846710', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'EDITION: the date 2022-02-23 comes from the file name (20220223-medical-service-corps.pdf); the PDF body prints no date. The file is hosted on api.army.mil under an upload path dated 3 May 2023, after the base pamphlet DA PAM 600-4, Army Medical Department Officer Career Management, dated 27 April 2023 (listed as the current, active edition by GlobalSpec, checked 2026-10-17; armypubs.army.mil could not be reached from this environment, and the Army G-1 publications page lists no DA PAM 600-4 chapter). The AMEDD chapter of DA PAM 600-3 (1 June 2017 text) points to DA PAM 600-4 for detail. No newer Medical Service Corps chapter was found, but it was not possible to confirm that none exists. TITLES: for 70D and 72D the chapter uses different words than DA PAM 611-21 (Nov 2025); the 611-21 title is used for the AOC and the chapter''s wording is noted on the description. Imported only for AOCs that DA PAM 611-21 lists without a description: 70A, 70B, 70C, 70D, 70E, 70F, 70H, 70K, 71A, 71B, 71E, 71F, 72A, 72B, 72C, 72D, 73A, 73B. Figures and tables of assignments by grade are not imported. LIMITATIONS: this is a 2022 chapter; duties and positions may have changed.', 'pdf-parse', 'army-600-4-20220223-medical-service-corps@2026-10-18', '0f55f817e011b8a87de37713a11d0256bbd110333b3418efa0d0e9dbc3670a3d')
